From 27e904228d28141aff4a4f0d17cdd768e619f641 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: jason-liu-4980 <38558962+jason-liu-4980@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 21:30:56 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 5/7] usb: support Orca controllers and PAM offload

Integrate Orca DWC3, PHY and reset handling with PAM USB offload. Add the SIPA-backed NCM/RNDIS paths and virtual serial gadget function, including their configuration and shared interfaces. Describe fixed host/peripheral roles in the bindings; board activation is separate.
